Error [jet.ReservedBindgenSegment]: Module path `c.demo.__bindgen__` uses the reserved segment `__bindgen__`
  --> tests/ui/generated_cffi_e3206.jet:1:16
    |
  1 | #Import module c.demo.__bindgen__ {
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Generated bindings live under `c.<lib>.__bindgen__`; user overlays use `#Import module c.<lib>`
 Fix: Remove `.__bindgen__` and declare the overlay as `#Import module c.<lib>`
